&lt;li&gt;Build and validate a new analytical method or tool that expands how Figma’s Data Science team solves recurring problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study marketing or customer-journey data to identify drivers of acquisition, conversion, or retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and evaluate forecasts or models that help teams anticipate user or business trends and plan more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
